version 0.19.0
component d-bat54c

kind         part
mpn          BAT54C
manufacturer onsemi
category     diode
datasheet    https://www.onsemi.com/download/data-sheet/pdf/bat54-d.pdf

symbol power:dual-diode
footprint sot:sot-23

# The part's own rating (ADR-0026): what the device is, not what the design asks of it.
# Per the onsemi BAT54 series datasheet (2017-09, Rev. 3), Absolute Maximum Ratings: maximum
# repetitive reverse voltage V_RRM 30 V. The terminal pair names the two pins the rating is about:
# from = the anode A1 (pin 1), to = the common cathode K (pin 3); A2 (pin 2) is the second anode
# and is not used here. A diode's reverse rating covers the reverse polarity only (ADR-0075 D3).
ratings
  reverse_voltage  voltage  30V  1 3

pins
  1  A1  passive
  2  A2  no_connect
  3  K   passive
